author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Default current reads expose all unresolved declared blockers plus a resolved count; Unknown and external references remain unresolved; Custom terminal statuses use the runtime registry; Explicit and historical projections remain truthful and recoverable.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Trustworthy bounded context and SDK-owned evidence
value: Agents can act on one truthful context read and preserve durable evidence
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: medium
expected_result: Default current reads expose all unresolved declared blockers plus a resolved count; Unknown and external references remain unresolved; Custom terminal statuses use the runtime registry; Explicit and historical projections remain truthful and recoverable.
