body: "GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1388\nReported version: 2026.10.4\n\nDefault get retains a compatibility scalar but supplies no live status for the complete declared blocker set. Resolve declared references with the shared actionability SDK primitives without enumerating unrelated items.\n\nThe complete public issue and its comments were read. This record is intake; the report is not independently reproduced or fixed yet. The completed predecessor pm-q6gx remains shipped work and is not represented as an outstanding failure.\n\nAcceptance: Default current reads expose all unresolved declared blockers plus a resolved count; Unknown and external references remain unresolved; Custom terminal statuses use the runtime registry; Explicit and historical projections remain truthful and recoverable."
